  "post_content": "<p>La sede de la Pe&ntilde;a Cultural Taurina &quot;Chicuelina&quot; de Onda ha acogido esta tarde una mesa redonda para analizar&nbsp;las ferias de la Magdalena y Fallas, la primera a cargo de Vicent Climent, profesor y escritor taurino, y la de Valencia por parte de Juan Mart&iacute;nez Fern&aacute;ndez, director del programa taurino de Popular TV. Les ha presentado Salvador Guinot, presidente de la entidad.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6218.jpg\" alt=\"img_6218\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6219.jpg\" alt=\"img_6219\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6220.jpg\" alt=\"img_6220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6221.jpg\" alt=\"img_6221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6222.jpg\" alt=\"img_6222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6223.jpg\" alt=\"img_6223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6224.jpg\" alt=\"img_6224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlachicuelinafallasmagdalena/img_6225.jpg\" alt=\"img_6225\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
